OL,3,GNEWSAHow teens race hovercrafts at
OL,4,A70mph with no brakes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeenagers from Bristol are racing
OL,7,Fhovercrafts at speeds of up to 70mph
OL,8,F(112km/h) in a motorsport where drivers
OL,9,Fhave no brakes and no conventional
OL,10,Fsteering.
OL,12,FRudy and Digby Dorman, along with Louie
OL,13,Fand JJ McGavin, are part of Team
OL,14,FPhoenix, a family-run team whose young
OL,15,Fracers have already won races and
OL,16,Fchampionships at European and world
OL,17,Flevel.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
