OL,3,GNEWSAHow teens race hovercrafts at
OL,4,A70mph with no brakes
OL,5,
OL,6,FHovercraft racing takes place on mixed
OL,7,Fland and water circuits, with drivers
OL,8,Fusing thrust, weight transfer,
OL,9,Faerodynamic drag and judgement to
OL,10,Fcontrol speed and direction.
OL,12,F"It feels like you're being pushed
OL,13,Falong in a shopping trolley really
OL,14,Ffast," said 15-year-old Rudy, whose
OL,15,Fhovercraft can reach speeds of up to
OL,16,F70mph.
